5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need a clear rule for usage. First-come-first-served is inefficient.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. We should prioritize quiet work over casual chat.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Before we decide, I want to know where the hidden costs are.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Exactly. I need the financial data before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,Wisdom lies in understanding the root cause. Let us examine the facts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the usage logs to see who occupies it most.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the partition wall to see if it can be improved.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I will investigate the invoices for outside hire to see the real cost.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I will review the fortnight's tally of use by person.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I will look at the crumbs and bins at the desks.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,The data will show us the pattern. We must be objective.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"A better wall might help with sound, but not with silence.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"If we pay for cleaning, we need to know the rate.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will also check the final clear-out of the old fridge.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will also check the unplanned talk since the refit.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Let us proceed with these investigations.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I hope this brings some clarity to our shared space.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I am curious to see what the numbers say.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Paper doesn't lie. Let's see what the paper says.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,May the truth guide our next steps.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
