35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The data shows two people dominate the room. The crumbs are everywhere.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The wall is thin. We hear everything. The talk is only by the printer.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"The invoices show we paid 68,000 yen for nine bookings. The tally shows two people used it eleven times.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The tally confirms the imbalance. The fridge clear-out shows the same person did it twice.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The crumbs are under the keys. The talk is only by the printer.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,We need a system that accounts for the heavy users.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If we hear everything, we need a place to speak without being overheard.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"We are paying for a service we barely use, while two people take it all.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,We are paying for a room that doesn't do the one thing we need.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,The mess is not the problem. The lack of a place to be is.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,I propose we designate it for focused work only.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I propose we make it a place for difficult conversations.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,I propose we stop paying for the outside hire and use this room properly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,I propose we look at the quotes for the two fit-outs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"I propose we make it a place where people can be, without being seen.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,Let us vote on the options.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I hope we choose the one that helps us connect.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I hope we choose the one that saves us money.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I hope we choose the one that makes sense on paper.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,I hope we choose the one that lets us breathe.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
